WEBVTT

00:10.677 --> 00:12.053
Teoritta...

00:12.137 --> 00:13.221
We did it...

00:13.763 --> 00:14.597
Yes.

00:14.681 --> 00:16.474
It was bound to happen.

00:16.558 --> 00:20.228
I allow you to rub my head
and sing my praises.

00:21.730 --> 00:23.773
Tell me, "You are indeed a goddess."

00:23.857 --> 00:25.775
"You are amazing, Teoritta!"

00:28.361 --> 00:29.738
You're amazing, Teoritta.

00:30.780 --> 00:32.991
You're a great goddess.

00:34.409 --> 00:36.703
Perhaps that's what everyone wants.

00:37.579 --> 00:40.415
When a job is completed

00:40.498 --> 00:41.833
and you're praised for it,

00:43.877 --> 00:48.131
some people probably think
it's worth risking their lives for.

01:09.694 --> 01:10.779
Help...

01:12.113 --> 01:13.907
Please help us...

01:13.990 --> 01:15.533
My dad...

01:15.617 --> 01:16.826
A creature did this...

01:17.494 --> 01:19.079
I have more people to protect now.

01:19.662 --> 01:23.041
- Teoritta, stay here...
- Little girl up ahead.

01:23.124 --> 01:24.042
Hey!

01:24.125 --> 01:25.627
Fear not.

01:25.710 --> 01:29.005
I, Goddess Teoritta,
and my knight, Xylo Forbartz,

01:29.088 --> 01:31.674
will guarantee your safety.

01:31.758 --> 01:34.719
We need to treat
that gentleman right away.

01:34.803 --> 01:36.930
What is your name?

01:37.013 --> 01:38.014
I...

01:38.097 --> 01:39.432
I'm...

01:40.517 --> 01:42.101
Are you all right?

01:46.648 --> 01:47.524
Teoritta!

01:51.361 --> 01:52.320
Die!

02:00.411 --> 02:01.830
Whoa, damn!

02:01.913 --> 02:03.248
Did I just hit a kid?

02:03.331 --> 02:04.499
Huh?

02:04.582 --> 02:06.835
That's weird.

02:06.918 --> 02:08.086
Tsav!

02:08.169 --> 02:09.921
Did you just shoot a civilian?

02:10.004 --> 02:13.174
No, I saw Teoritta being attacked...

02:13.258 --> 02:14.092
Huh?

02:14.175 --> 02:15.426
Don't "huh" me!

02:18.471 --> 02:20.807
How could... this happen?

02:27.647 --> 02:29.065
Did she get away?

02:29.149 --> 02:30.108
Teoritta!

02:30.608 --> 02:31.985
Are you hurt?

02:32.068 --> 02:33.945
I told you not to push yourself...

02:34.529 --> 02:35.572
Xylo...

02:35.655 --> 02:36.614
What?

02:37.198 --> 02:38.283
It looks like...

02:39.367 --> 02:42.412
I need to learn how to use this properly.

02:45.248 --> 02:47.041
You blocked it with this?

02:48.167 --> 02:50.378
We need to buy a better one.

02:51.212 --> 02:52.547
I'll train you properly.

02:53.464 --> 02:54.799
By the way,

02:55.300 --> 02:57.510
is that a faerie disguised as a human...?

02:59.971 --> 03:02.682
That might be Spriggan.

03:03.975 --> 03:06.269
It seems you truly are a threat

03:06.352 --> 03:08.146
to the Demon Blight.

03:08.855 --> 03:10.398
Just as I like it.

03:16.779 --> 03:20.450
A goddess's standards are always high.

03:21.117 --> 03:22.410
Let's go.

03:22.493 --> 03:25.204
Back to those lowlife bastards.

03:25.288 --> 03:26.122
Yes.

03:26.205 --> 03:28.750
After all, that's where we belong.

03:28.833 --> 03:30.585
But before that...

03:31.294 --> 03:33.296
You understand, right?

03:37.717 --> 03:40.720
You must give it your all

03:40.803 --> 03:43.264
and sing my praises

03:43.806 --> 03:45.475
with all your heart!

03:48.978 --> 03:52.732
Approximately 130 civilians
arrived at the refuge.

03:52.815 --> 03:54.317
There were no casualties.

03:54.400 --> 03:57.237
As expected of
our Thirteenth Order of the Holy Knights.

03:57.320 --> 03:59.906
It's all thanks to Commander Kivia's
excellent leadership.

04:00.490 --> 04:03.868
But where did the Commander
and the Infantry Lieutenant go?

04:05.536 --> 04:08.623
I guess they wanted us
to take the credit this time.

04:08.706 --> 04:12.543
After all, the Commander and Rajit
always get the credit first.

04:15.421 --> 04:17.924
Thank you for your gallant efforts.

04:18.007 --> 04:21.344
I hope the military and the Temple
will continue to work together

04:21.427 --> 04:23.471
- Sorry to keep you waiting.
- and strive for the good of this town!

04:23.554 --> 04:24.389
- How did it go?
- Yes, sir!

04:24.889 --> 04:25.807
- Frenci.
- Well then,

04:25.890 --> 04:27.267
everyone, back to your posts.

04:27.350 --> 04:28.810
Provide aid to the evacuees.

04:28.893 --> 04:31.479
- It's just as you predicted.
- Yes, sir!

04:53.876 --> 04:54.877
First...

04:55.795 --> 04:58.172
I need to repair the damage...

04:59.966 --> 05:01.217
and find...

05:01.801 --> 05:04.971
a new host body...

05:09.309 --> 05:11.311
There you are.

05:15.106 --> 05:18.234
I wanted to see you, Spriggan.

05:20.528 --> 05:21.738
Huh?

05:21.821 --> 05:22.989
You didn't know?

05:23.948 --> 05:26.784
Actually, when the Demon Blight
corrupts the surroundings,

05:26.868 --> 05:27.910
it has a unique...

05:28.411 --> 05:29.495
how should I put it?

05:29.579 --> 05:30.872
A unique "wavelength."

05:31.372 --> 05:33.875
If you're of the same race,
you can pick up that wavelength.

05:33.958 --> 05:36.669
That's how I tracked you here.

05:36.753 --> 05:37.837
Who... are you...?

05:37.920 --> 05:40.590
By the way, do you know, Spriggan?

05:41.215 --> 05:44.510
I'm a penal hero,

05:44.594 --> 05:50.892
but among the Penal Hero Unit,
my crime seems to be the least serious

05:50.975 --> 05:53.728
and the most straightforward.

05:56.397 --> 05:58.191
What do you think it is?

06:03.446 --> 06:04.280
Eek...

06:07.742 --> 06:08.910
It is...

06:09.994 --> 06:12.371
killing my own kind.

06:13.039 --> 06:16.292
Because I feel pleasure in such acts.

06:18.086 --> 06:19.796
Humans are amazing.

06:19.879 --> 06:22.381
They say this kind of hobby
is quite common,

06:22.465 --> 06:25.384
and the motive behind it is very boring.

06:25.468 --> 06:26.344
Don't come near me!

06:26.427 --> 06:30.014
- Being called boring is truly something.
- Don't come near me...!

06:30.098 --> 06:32.433
So I simply surrendered.

06:32.517 --> 06:35.603
I did everything they told me to do.

06:35.686 --> 06:38.648
Now I'm also learning about their ethics.

06:38.731 --> 06:42.443
And I've come to understand
that to you, Demon Blights,

06:42.527 --> 06:44.654
I'm merely a murderer.

06:45.321 --> 06:48.032
- No!
- Killing your own kind for pleasure.

06:48.116 --> 06:51.536
- Let go of me!
- Such a trite and boring act of murder...

06:51.619 --> 06:53.287
- Stop!
- But to humans,

06:53.371 --> 06:55.748
- Let go of me! Let go!
- this seems to make one a hero.

06:55.832 --> 06:56.916
Why is that?

06:57.667 --> 07:00.419
I still can't properly explain
the reasoning behind it.

07:00.503 --> 07:01.504
Let go!

07:02.171 --> 07:03.548
Yes, yes.

07:03.631 --> 07:05.716
The sounds you've been making...

07:05.800 --> 07:07.718
are music to my ears.

07:08.261 --> 07:10.263
It excites me greatly.

07:10.346 --> 07:12.890
It makes me want
to take my time killing you.

07:15.893 --> 07:18.896
Oh, right. I forgot to introduce myself.

07:20.982 --> 07:24.485
I am the Demon Blight, Puck Puca.

07:24.569 --> 07:28.614
Before humans, I call myself
by the name of this body's original owner,

07:29.198 --> 07:31.159
"Rhyno."

07:33.286 --> 07:34.328
Well then...

07:34.412 --> 07:35.788
Sweet dreams,

07:35.872 --> 07:37.290
Spriggan.

07:47.592 --> 07:50.887
I'm unable to continue the mission...

07:50.970 --> 07:55.141
I'll disappoint my king again...

07:57.852 --> 07:58.686
Yes.

07:59.437 --> 08:02.440
I used a Blood Doll as a substitute.

08:03.608 --> 08:06.736
That Holy Sword is too dangerous...

08:07.236 --> 08:12.450
To kill them, I need more human blood...

08:17.622 --> 08:19.874
I've heard of your valiant efforts.

08:20.500 --> 08:21.834
Well done.

08:21.918 --> 08:22.835
Outstanding.

08:23.419 --> 08:25.087
Thank you.

08:25.963 --> 08:31.761
I've also heard that your deployment
and command were impeccable, Uncle.

08:31.844 --> 08:33.888
It was merely good fortune.

08:34.430 --> 08:37.266
It must've been a blessing
from the ancient saints.

08:38.309 --> 08:39.769
Your achievements this time

08:39.852 --> 08:43.272
should allow you to rise to the top
among the High Priests.

08:43.856 --> 08:46.651
If such an honor
is truly bestowed upon me,

08:46.734 --> 08:49.028
I'll begin with a personnel reshuffle.

08:49.111 --> 08:52.406
We need to be more united.

08:52.490 --> 08:54.033
When that happens, Patausche,

08:54.116 --> 08:57.995
we must improve your current situation.

09:04.377 --> 09:06.671
Personnel reshuffle, you say?

09:07.672 --> 09:08.506
Then,

09:09.006 --> 09:12.176
are you going to replace
the entire Temple leadership

09:12.260 --> 09:14.136
with members of the coexisters?

09:23.813 --> 09:26.649
Did you interrogate Lideo Sodrick?

09:27.984 --> 09:31.112
The envoy of coexisters he met...

09:31.195 --> 09:33.489
Mahaeyzel Zelkoff...

09:33.573 --> 09:37.076
When priests pray
for good fortune in battle,

09:37.159 --> 09:38.828
everyone uses this name.

09:38.911 --> 09:40.204
What's wrong?

09:40.830 --> 09:43.165
In the Central and other regions,

09:43.249 --> 09:45.626
it's pronounced "Zelkoof."

09:45.710 --> 09:49.630
Only people from the north
would pronounce it "Zelkoff."

09:52.300 --> 09:55.595
Considering the wealth required
to mobilize the Adventurers Guild

09:55.678 --> 09:58.431
and the clue that the person
is a Temple official from the North,

09:59.307 --> 10:01.892
we can narrow down the suspect.

10:02.935 --> 10:03.936
Uncle...

10:04.562 --> 10:08.065
Whenever you had the chance,
you took me outside to see the world,

10:08.149 --> 10:10.401
even though I was a child
who knew nothing about it.

10:12.862 --> 10:15.656
When I wanted to take
a different path from my parents...

10:15.740 --> 10:18.743
and forge my own path,

10:20.369 --> 10:22.913
you provided me with what I needed...

10:24.040 --> 10:25.499
This sword is one of them.

10:29.795 --> 10:32.089
When you took me out into the streets,

10:32.757 --> 10:37.011
the alias you always used was Zelkoff.

10:38.512 --> 10:39.972
You remembered.

10:40.473 --> 10:42.433
How could I forget?

10:42.975 --> 10:46.896
Of course, I've also checked
your movement records.

10:46.979 --> 10:49.315
And in the previous battle,

10:49.398 --> 10:53.486
the unit that discovered the Demon Blight
invading the Inland District,

10:54.195 --> 10:56.238
according to you,

10:56.322 --> 10:58.949
was Unit 7110.

11:00.201 --> 11:03.037
However, no such unit exists.

11:06.165 --> 11:08.417
You've done your research.

11:13.422 --> 11:14.465
Uncle.

11:15.174 --> 11:17.343
Why are you siding with the coexisters?

11:19.553 --> 11:22.181
It's for the people I care about.

11:22.765 --> 11:25.059
Please don't move, Uncle!

11:26.727 --> 11:29.355
Me and my family.

11:29.438 --> 11:30.481
Uncle!

11:32.358 --> 11:36.112
And the faithful
who devote themselves to the Temple.

11:36.695 --> 11:39.281
I want to save them.

11:41.867 --> 11:42.910
Patausche.

11:45.413 --> 11:47.915
Humanity will fall.

11:48.791 --> 11:50.459
That's why I hope

11:50.543 --> 11:54.505
that at least those with righteous hearts
and my beloved family

11:55.047 --> 11:56.674
can remain safe.

11:58.592 --> 11:59.927
Then...

12:00.886 --> 12:02.680
What about everyone else?

12:02.763 --> 12:04.557
I don't care!

12:06.267 --> 12:08.269
Isn't that how everyone is?

12:08.352 --> 12:09.311
Patausche.

12:10.354 --> 12:14.191
Or would you rather be a hero
who saves strangers

12:14.275 --> 12:16.735
instead of your own family?

12:17.319 --> 12:18.696
Uncle, I just--

12:18.779 --> 12:24.118
You're still too naive.
You still have a lot of growing up to do.

12:25.536 --> 12:28.122
Hurry and grow up, Patausche.

12:28.706 --> 12:32.543
Learn to love your family
and those around you.

12:33.752 --> 12:37.756
If possible, I hope you'll take part
in the future workings of this world

12:37.840 --> 12:41.218
as a member of the coexisters.

12:41.802 --> 12:43.262
I...

12:43.345 --> 12:46.432
Humanity will be defeated
by the Demon Blight.

12:47.057 --> 12:49.810
Among the surviving humans,

12:49.894 --> 12:52.146
we must take our place as overseers

12:52.980 --> 12:56.400
and lead the rest of the people
to the right path--

12:56.484 --> 12:57.651
Please, just stop!

13:02.114 --> 13:03.449
It's such a shame...

13:04.116 --> 13:05.117
Uncle...

13:09.330 --> 13:10.289
I...

13:10.873 --> 13:11.916
I truly...

13:12.583 --> 13:13.751
truly...

13:15.044 --> 13:17.296
respected you very much...

13:20.508 --> 13:22.009
Are you crying?

13:23.969 --> 13:24.929
Even if...

13:25.804 --> 13:28.224
those people have nothing to do with me...

13:29.225 --> 13:32.144
even if they are strangers...

13:32.853 --> 13:34.271
to abandon them

13:35.314 --> 13:36.607
would be a grave mistake.

13:36.690 --> 13:37.983
Patausche.

13:38.609 --> 13:42.738
That's a very self-righteous
and abnormal thought.

13:43.614 --> 13:47.785
You could also call it
the heroism of an inflated ego.

13:47.868 --> 13:50.913
Now that I think about it,
perhaps I raised you this way...

13:50.996 --> 13:51.830
Shut up!

13:51.914 --> 13:53.749
Rajit, arrest him!

13:53.832 --> 13:54.667
Yes!

13:56.794 --> 13:59.004
Please, atone for your sins...

14:07.471 --> 14:08.597
Commander!

14:33.581 --> 14:34.790
This is such a shame...

14:35.291 --> 14:36.417
Patausche.

14:37.251 --> 14:40.379
I truly thought of you...

14:40.963 --> 14:42.256
as my own daughter.

15:12.036 --> 15:12.870
Hurry!

15:12.953 --> 15:13.787
- What's going on?
- This way!

15:13.871 --> 15:15.039
High Priest Marlen!

15:39.772 --> 15:41.899
Has Rhyno not returned yet?

15:42.483 --> 15:44.443
It'll be trouble if Kivia finds out.

15:44.944 --> 15:46.362
Venetim.

15:46.445 --> 15:49.573
It's about time we put
a collar or chain on that guy.

15:49.657 --> 15:53.077
You're one to talk, Jayce.

15:53.160 --> 15:54.620
Oh, my.

15:54.703 --> 15:57.039
I think we can just leave Rhyno alone.

15:58.040 --> 16:00.000
He could be taking advantage
of the situation.

16:00.084 --> 16:02.670
Or maybe he's captured a faerie
and is torturing it.

16:02.753 --> 16:07.216
I once saw him bring back a living faerie.

16:07.299 --> 16:09.134
Isn't that right, Dotta?

16:09.218 --> 16:10.135
Yeah.

16:10.219 --> 16:12.054
He said he'd make it a specimen
or something like that.

16:12.137 --> 16:13.263
Heh.

16:15.057 --> 16:16.058
- Hey!
- Bro!

16:16.141 --> 16:18.435
Please save some for me!

16:18.519 --> 16:19.603
Fool!

16:19.687 --> 16:22.940
You're the one with the least work.
What nonsense are you talking about?

16:23.023 --> 16:25.859
Tsav! I order you and Rhyno
to reflect on your actions!

16:25.943 --> 16:27.194
No way!

16:27.277 --> 16:29.905
I saved Teoritta from a crisis!

16:29.989 --> 16:31.448
Whatever.

16:31.532 --> 16:33.367
Let's get this over with
and call it a day.

16:36.578 --> 16:37.579
Xylo.

16:37.663 --> 16:38.497
Huh?

16:40.082 --> 16:40.958
Frenci.

16:41.875 --> 16:43.669
You look like a mess.

16:43.752 --> 16:45.921
Why are you just sitting here?

16:46.005 --> 16:48.799
I'm sorry, but we're closed for the day.

16:48.882 --> 16:50.968
If you don't want it, then give it to me!

16:52.136 --> 16:54.888
I don't want to be scolded by you anymore.

16:54.972 --> 16:56.890
How disgraceful.

16:56.974 --> 16:59.435
And you call yourself
a son-in-law of the Mastibolt family?

16:59.518 --> 17:02.312
You're worse than a hibernating lemur.

17:02.396 --> 17:04.231
All right, give me a break.

17:04.314 --> 17:05.357
We're done here.

17:06.233 --> 17:07.317
Yes.

17:07.401 --> 17:11.113
However, their attack on this town
was just a diversion.

17:12.031 --> 17:12.865
What?

17:14.158 --> 17:15.200
Huh?

17:15.284 --> 17:16.744
You mean...

17:16.827 --> 17:19.455
The Demon Blight, Abaddon.

17:19.538 --> 17:22.541
It's said to have breached the defenses
of the Ninth Order of Holy Knights

17:22.624 --> 17:24.960
and launched a surprise assault
on the Second Capital.

17:27.212 --> 17:29.214
You mean my capital...

17:29.298 --> 17:33.469
It was attacked by the faeries...?

17:34.470 --> 17:38.682
They knew our every move.
We've been completely outwitted.

17:39.433 --> 17:40.601
Don't tell me...

17:40.684 --> 17:41.852
Yes.

17:42.436 --> 17:43.562
The Second Capital

17:44.188 --> 17:45.189
has fallen.

17:48.525 --> 17:53.238
The Second Capital, Zeyllent,
is the symbol of the Federated Kingdom.

17:53.322 --> 17:55.074
It's also a key defense point.

17:59.745 --> 18:00.788
Sigh...

18:02.790 --> 18:05.751
Now, Galtuile Fortress
and the First Capital

18:05.834 --> 18:09.338
are like having a blade at their throats.

18:13.926 --> 18:15.719
I heard he was killed
by a close acquaintance.

18:15.803 --> 18:17.179
Isn't he a big shot in the Temple?

18:17.262 --> 18:19.515
Excuse me, please let us through...

18:20.140 --> 18:22.601
Why did you kill High Priest Marlen?

18:22.684 --> 18:24.269
- Move aside!
- You're the one who should die!

18:24.353 --> 18:25.854
You heretic!

18:25.938 --> 18:26.980
Sentence her to death!

18:27.648 --> 18:29.525
Alright, move out of the way!

18:29.608 --> 18:30.567
Commander...

18:30.651 --> 18:32.444
No way...

18:42.538 --> 18:46.125
Patausche Kivia, Commander of
the Thirteenth Order of the Holy Knights.

18:46.208 --> 18:51.964
Why did you kill High Priest Marlen Kivia
and Infantry Lieutenant Rajit Heathrow?

18:52.047 --> 18:54.883
How many times are you going
to ask me the same question?

18:54.967 --> 18:57.136
- My uncle was part of the coexisters--
- No.

18:58.262 --> 19:02.266
You were afraid of High Priest Marlen's
popularity and abilities.

19:02.808 --> 19:06.270
That's why you betrayed humanity
and killed your uncle.

19:07.437 --> 19:10.941
As long as you can
accurately present the facts,

19:11.024 --> 19:13.068
I'll let you go immediately.

19:13.861 --> 19:15.737
What happened to my subordinates?

19:19.283 --> 19:20.909
The hero unit.

19:20.993 --> 19:23.162
What's Xylo Forbartz's status?

19:25.205 --> 19:27.457
Why wasn't there a trial?

19:27.541 --> 19:29.918
Let me say it in court!

19:33.130 --> 19:35.257
Please reconsider.

19:35.924 --> 19:37.801
We have plenty of time.

20:00.240 --> 20:02.534
My apologies.

20:02.618 --> 20:05.621
It took some time to discuss.

20:06.955 --> 20:09.875
Because there's only room for one more.

20:09.958 --> 20:11.877
I hesitated for a while.

20:22.971 --> 20:24.806
Patausche Kivia.

20:24.890 --> 20:28.101
Former Commander of the Thirteenth Order
of the Holy Knights.

20:28.769 --> 20:31.521
Setting aside your abilities as a soldier,

20:31.605 --> 20:34.858
your mental strength is truly amazing.

20:34.942 --> 20:35.901
You killed someone important

20:35.984 --> 20:38.070
who'd shown you kindness
with your own hands.

20:38.904 --> 20:41.531
For the sake of people you've never met,

20:41.615 --> 20:44.826
you even punished
your most revered benefactor

20:44.910 --> 20:45.994
without mercy.

20:46.495 --> 20:50.332
This is clearly an act beyond
the scope of personal interest.

20:50.958 --> 20:53.835
It could be called a hero's conviction.

20:53.919 --> 20:57.381
Or perhaps, a mere delusion.

20:59.258 --> 21:01.760
How... do you know...?

21:02.427 --> 21:05.264
My goddess can summon books.

21:05.764 --> 21:09.226
You could also say
she summons information.

21:12.771 --> 21:15.190
I know, Enfié.

21:16.358 --> 21:17.484
Thank you.

21:18.735 --> 21:19.695
Are you...

21:20.737 --> 21:22.698
a Holy Knight?

21:25.409 --> 21:26.493
That's right.

21:26.576 --> 21:28.870
The Twelfth Order of the Holy Knights.

21:28.954 --> 21:33.333
So, we used to be colleagues.

21:35.877 --> 21:39.423
I'm here to offer you a choice.

21:39.506 --> 21:41.008
You have two paths before you.

21:41.591 --> 21:42.467
The first path:

21:43.093 --> 21:46.513
accept the death penalty
as a member of the coexisters.

21:47.597 --> 21:49.016
The second path:

21:49.099 --> 21:50.934
become a penal hero

21:51.018 --> 21:53.729
and continue to fight the Demon Blight.

21:57.149 --> 21:59.735
A hero will be resurrected
even if they die.

21:59.818 --> 22:01.862
They have no freedom of action.

22:02.487 --> 22:03.739
Nor do they have honor.

22:04.239 --> 22:07.534
They will sacrifice everything
for people they've never met.

22:08.285 --> 22:10.704
If it were me, I'd probably refuse.

22:10.787 --> 22:14.291
And personally, I don't think
you're suited for this path.

22:14.875 --> 22:15.959
A hero...

22:17.377 --> 22:19.379
What exactly is a penal hero?

22:23.300 --> 22:25.719
I'll answer as much as I can reveal.

22:26.303 --> 22:29.056
I'm sure you've heard some rumors.

22:29.598 --> 22:34.478
The first goddess
has the power to summon heroes.

22:35.687 --> 22:38.065
Long ago, at the start of the Great War,

22:38.148 --> 22:41.359
she summoned heroes from another world.

22:42.069 --> 22:45.614
But she couldn't communicate with them.

22:48.325 --> 22:51.912
So the people of the past
changed their approach.

22:52.704 --> 22:58.585
They summoned those who died
in this world as heroes.

23:00.837 --> 23:03.006
Summon the dead...

23:04.633 --> 23:05.884
Resurrection?

23:05.967 --> 23:07.761
That's right.

23:09.471 --> 23:13.600
They will stand on the front lines
of the battle against the Demon Blight.

23:13.683 --> 23:15.936
Even death is not permitted.

23:16.019 --> 23:17.979
They continue to fight on.

23:19.356 --> 23:21.108
So that's a hero...

23:22.901 --> 23:24.069
A penal hero...

23:24.778 --> 23:26.363
Precisely.

23:26.863 --> 23:29.991
And the reason it's now
a form of punishment...

23:30.492 --> 23:33.829
Well, there are many reasons for that.

23:34.329 --> 23:35.163
And,

23:35.247 --> 23:38.834
the first goddess's power is not perfect.

23:39.417 --> 23:41.461
If she resurrects someone multiple times,

23:41.545 --> 23:45.048
you know what happens, right?

23:48.677 --> 23:50.971
You lose part of your memory,

23:51.763 --> 23:54.683
and your mind is worn away...

23:55.183 --> 24:00.480
Humans seem to have
something called "soul."

24:00.564 --> 24:04.860
The more accurately
she can "recall" the subject,

24:05.360 --> 24:10.490
the more precise the summoning,
or rather, the resurrection, will be.

24:10.574 --> 24:14.744
Although Enfié's records can also assist,

24:15.328 --> 24:19.416
the first goddess is doing her utmost,

24:19.499 --> 24:23.753
recalling the memories of the heroes
day and night.

24:23.837 --> 24:28.967
There's only enough unused space
for one person left, at most.

24:30.635 --> 24:32.304
To go that far...

24:34.264 --> 24:37.100
Can a hero truly be a trump card?

24:39.561 --> 24:41.021
I suppose so.

24:41.855 --> 24:46.193
That's what I personally hope.

24:46.985 --> 24:49.529
These are the only secrets I can reveal.

24:50.155 --> 24:54.117
We'll talk about the binding sacred seals
and "repair" another time.

24:56.161 --> 24:57.204
Now then,

24:57.829 --> 24:59.623
what is your choice,

24:59.706 --> 25:01.833
Patausche Kivia?

25:09.466 --> 25:11.760
If I say I'm willing to become a hero,

25:12.552 --> 25:15.472
will you release me from here?

25:15.972 --> 25:17.474
Yes.

25:17.557 --> 25:20.685
But you must die once.

25:20.769 --> 25:23.605
You will be dismembered
and removed from here.

25:24.356 --> 25:26.816
That is the only thing
I cannot compromise on.

25:26.900 --> 25:29.444
You can either die
believing in the goddess

25:29.527 --> 25:31.988
or die not believing.

25:32.072 --> 25:34.532
Those are the only two options.

25:38.828 --> 25:40.455
I...

25:41.039 --> 25:42.916
was born into a family of priests.

25:43.500 --> 25:45.126
I ended up abandoning my family...

25:46.461 --> 25:49.005
My uncle, who was one of the few
who understood me,

25:50.840 --> 25:52.509
was killed by my own hand.

25:54.928 --> 25:58.723
I've thought countless times
in this darkness...

25:59.599 --> 26:04.896
how my subordinates and the hero unit
would view my crime...

26:06.856 --> 26:10.151
If they think I've gone mad,
I can accept that.

26:10.902 --> 26:11.736
But

26:12.237 --> 26:14.114
if they despise me...

26:15.699 --> 26:21.246
and think I'm one of the coexisters
who betrayed humanity...

26:25.292 --> 26:26.918
To be seen that way...

26:28.128 --> 26:31.006
by my subordinates and that man...

26:36.553 --> 26:37.762
I can't bear it...

26:45.103 --> 26:46.146
If...

26:47.897 --> 26:49.190
If I can...

26:49.733 --> 26:51.901
raise my sword and fight again,

26:53.278 --> 26:54.237
then...

26:55.196 --> 27:00.160
I vow here and now that I will fight
for those I have never met.

27:01.911 --> 27:03.621
I will become a hero.

27:14.591 --> 27:15.842
I understand...

27:16.343 --> 27:19.012
You cannot regret this.

27:19.095 --> 27:20.889
I don't recommend it either.

27:21.473 --> 27:24.392
I'll take measures to ensure your silence.

27:25.560 --> 27:27.187
Personally,

27:27.687 --> 27:30.774
I'm still against making you a hero.

27:32.525 --> 27:34.402
However,

27:35.153 --> 27:38.573
I respect your vow.

27:39.199 --> 27:41.951
Now, take it.

28:00.470 --> 28:03.098
For the sake of humanity,

28:03.181 --> 28:06.267
show me your resolve.

28:08.937 --> 28:10.605
Patausche Kivia.

28:11.231 --> 28:12.190
I am

28:12.732 --> 28:14.359
sentencing you

28:15.360 --> 28:16.945
to be a hero.
